// A budget for a young person: envelopes for the month and for the year, money set
// aside for the car and the trip, subscriptions, a wallet of cash that does not
// add up, a check in the mail and a deposit that bounced. September 2025 to
// mid-February 2026, with a question for June: can I afford a 3,000 USD trip?
//
// The folders are constraints: journal/2025/09.ax holds September 2025 only.

base USD

use std
use us

/// Jamie, 24, a junior designer at a studio, single, in a city with no state
/// income tax.
entity me : person
  born   2001-05-01
  filing single
  lives  us
